  - ollama
  - reproducibility

abstract: >-
  forkland is a self-contained, self-improving AI agent that lives in a
  git repository, plans/builds/tests/deploys/rolls back improvements to
  itself, and runs on local Ollama with no paid APIs. v0.2 introduces a
  research substrate: a SHA-256-chained capability ledger, a patch
  graveyard for negative-example learning, a multi-objective fitness
  function, A/B lineage experiments, phylogenetic replay of ancestor
  agents, an append-only diary, and a grant hunter module. The agent
  dogfoods itself from the first push: every change is gated by its own
  test suite and the entire evolutionary history is auditable from the
  git log.

